      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_lKpLABImEJpUhX0vH_nts2I2D7VdU0GDV5GCmRv1KSNQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "I was born there in a small town called Eefde which is in Gelderland which is near the German border.\nWe lived in a farm house and travelled 15 kms  to school by pushbike and then home again which could be difficult if it was wet windy or snowing.\nThere was a creek near our place that went all the way to a canal and in winter we would skate via the creek to where the canal had overflowed and iced over and skate for hours.\nWe moved to Australia in 1969 with mum dad and 5 brothers and 2 sisters when I was 11 for better opportunities.",
